---
/**
 * Homepage rhythm-break: a dark technical section.
 *
 * This diagram is the TKMC *family capability envelope*, not a literal
 * electrical topology. Catalog v1.3 (website/src/data/products.ts) supports
 * battery storage + DC EV charging on every published model. PV input and
 * AC output are model-specific. Grid-complementary deployment is catalogued
 * only on stationary TKMC-2000 / TKMC-2600; AC 3-phase recharge is a
 * recharge mode, not a universal live grid-input path. Do not draw
 * PV → battery → EV or Grid → battery → AC as a definitive wiring diagram.
 *
 * TODO(engineering): confirm whether any single configuration operates PV
 * and grid as simultaneous interchangeable inputs, and whether AC output
 * and DC charging run in parallel on models that publish both.
 */
---

<section class="energy-flow" aria-labelledby="energy-flow-heading">
  <div class="energy-flow-inner">
    <p class="label-tech">Energy flow</p>
    <h2 id="energy-flow-heading" class="energy-flow-title">One platform. Multiple deployment paths.</h2>
    <p class="energy-flow-body">The TKMC range combines battery storage and DC charging, with AC output or PV-storage capabilities available on selected configurations.</p>

    <div class="energy-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="energy-node">
        <span class="energy-node-id">01</span>
        <span class="energy-node-label">Supported input options</span>
        <span class="energy-node-meta">Selected: PV / grid</span>
      </div>
      <div class="energy-line energy-line-pulse"></div>
      <div class="energy-core">
        <span class="energy-node-id">02</span>
        <span class="energy-node-label">TKMC storage</span>
        <span class="energy-node-meta">Energy core</span>
      </div>
      <div class="energy-line"></div>
      <div class="energy-node">
        <span class="energy-node-id">03</span>
        <span class="energy-node-label">Supported output options</span>
        <span class="energy-node-meta">DC charging / selected AC</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="energy-flow-note">Conceptual path of the family capability envelope. Not a wiring diagram. Final configuration is project-specific.</p>

    <ul class="energy-caps">
      <li><span>Storage</span></li>
      <li><span>DC charging</span></li>
      <li><span>Selected AC output</span></li>
      <li><span>Selected PV input</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
